) Kd7 16. R8b7+ Kd6 17. Rc7 $1 {e.g} Qd3 18. Rc6+ $11 (18. Rc8 $144 Qf1 19. Rc6+ $11)) ({similar play after -} Qf1 $144 15. Rb8+ $1 $11 {etc}) (Qc3 $144 15. Rb8+ Kd7 16. R5b7+ Ke6 (Kd6 $144 17. Rd8+ $11) 17. Rb6+ Ke5 (Bxb6 $144 18. axb6 $11) 18. Re8+ Kf4 19. Rf8+ (19. Rd8 $144 Bxb6 (Be5 $144 20. Kb5 Bc7 21. Rd7 $11) (Qc5 $144 20. Rxd4+ Qxd4 21. Ka7 $11) (Qc4+ $144 20. Kb7 $11) (Qd3+ $144 20. Kb7 Qc4 $11) 20. axb6 $11) Ke4 20. Re8+ Kf3 21. Rf8+ Ke2 22. Re8+ Kd3 23. Re3+ {(b3)} Bxe3 24. Rb3 Qxb3 $11 {stalemate}) (Be5 $144 15. Ka7 $1 Qd4+ 16. Ka8 $11) 15. Rc7 $3 (15. Rb8+ $143 Kd7 16. R8b7+ Kd6 17. Rc7 (17. Rb8 $144 Be3 $19) Qxc7 $19) Qxc7 (Kxc7 $144 $11 {stalemate}) (Qe6+ $144 16. Rb6 $1 Bxb6 17. axb6 $11) 16. Rb8+ $1 Qxb8 $11 {stalemate.} (Kd7 $144 17. Rb7 $11 {. The attracts wealth of the contents of this study. Here can see the refuse of the capture, nice stalemates, changes and other interesting tactical moments. A lot of unexpected turns in the play. Despite some difficult analytical support lines, study is a high class work! It should be noted that some lines of the author's text are not unique and are not shown here. Also, reduced abundance of exclamation points. But, these moments do not affect the quality of the study.}) 1/2-1/2

