1. Kd7+ Kf7 (Kh7 $144 2. f7 $18) 2. Rf8+ Kg6 3. f7 Kf6 $1 {Almost positional draw} (Rd2+ $144 {interesting, but spees up the solution} 4. Ke8 $1 Re2+ (Kf6 $144 5. Be7+ Ke6 6. Rh8 $18) 5. Be7 Rf2 (Re1 $144 6. Rh8 $18) 6. Bd6 Rf1 (Re2+ $144 7. Kd7 $18) 7. Ke7 Re1+ 8. Kd7 Rf1 (Re2 $144 9. Re8 $18) (Ra1 $144 9. Ke6 $18) 9. Ke6 $18) (Re1 $144 {weak} 4. Re8 Rd1+ 5. Ke7 Re1+ 6. Kf8 $18) (Ra2 $144 {speeds up the solution} 4. Bd6 Kf6 (Ra7+ $144 5. Ke6 $18) 5. Be5+ Kg6 6. Ke6 $18) (Rf2 $144 4. Ke8 $1 Re2+ 5. Be7 $18 {see 3...Td2}) 4. Bb4 $1 {First phase. Rook is displaced from the e-file and king will win the square e6.} (4. Bd6 $143 Rd2 $11 {positional draw}) Re3 $1 (Re4 $144 5. Bc3+ Kg6 6. Re8 $18) 5. Bc5 $1 Rb3 {the rook cannot stay on e-file} (Re4 $144 6. Re8 $18) (Re2 $144 6. Bd4+ Kg6 7. Re8 $18) 6. Bd4+ $1 (6. Be7+ $144 {loses time} Kg6 7. Bd6 Kf6 8. Be5+ Kg6 9. Ke6 Rb7 10. Bg3 Rb6+ 11. Bd6 Rb7 12. Bc5 $18 {transposes to the main}) Kg6 7. Ke6 (7. Ke7 $144 {loses time} Rb7+ 8. Ke6 Rc7 9. Be5 Rb7 10. Bg3 Rb6+ 11. Bd6 Rb7 12. Bc5 $18) (7. Be5 $144 {loses time} Ra3 8. Ke6 Ra6+ 9. Bd6 Ra7 10. Bb8 Rb7 11. Bf4 Rb6+ 12. Bd6 Rb7 13. Bc5 $18) Rb7 {Phase 2 - rook is displaced from the 7th rank} 8. Bc5 $1 {Critical position, the solution has to run through} Rc7 (Rb1 $144 9. Re8 $1 Re1+ 10. Kd7 Rd1+ 11. Ke7 Re1+ 12. Kf8 $18) 9. Be7 $1 {important moment} Rc1 (Ra7 $144 10. Rd8 $18) (Rc6+ $144 10. Bd6 {point} Ra6 11. Rd8 $18) 10. Bd6 $1 (10. Rd8 $143 Re1+ $11) Re1+ 11. Be5 Rf1 {the last chance} 12. Bxg7 $1 Re1+ (Kxg7 $144 13. Rg8+ $18) 13. Be5 $18 1-0

